  One thing to expect: with verification off, [38;5;153mrequests[39m will print [38;5;153mInsecureRequestWarning[39m on every staging call. I left
  it unsuppressed deliberately — it's a useful signal if the flag ever leaks into a non-staging run. Say the word if
  you'd rather silence it, or if you actually did want verification off unconditionally.

